{
  "description": "Conversation card URL policy shared by the Android app, the iOS app and the Home Assistant companion. HTTPS or root-relative only; scheme case is normalized to lowercase; userinfo, whitespace, backslashes, other schemes and protocol-relative URLs are rejected. Values over 2048 characters are rejected, never truncated (tested in each platform). Bracketed hosts must be valid IPv6 literals; names need non-empty labels.",
